{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_095d2b2117c26395a87995bb7449f852a385c304e5adf5afa63e30afa7e953df","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b6de10248ffa3eaf30af9d8009f0b9f3354b5751f437a98c6c91ecde23742e1f"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"Requires Node >= 18 and at least one of opencode, claude, or codex on the PATH.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1727cac146f16a84ce041e2539180c8022e2b3392d88aba4c221ae593ce297f3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_c540cd2829da51c0780d3226023fb2d17577306281631a0eda4e0892d5ba407b","slc_e6fb4e78bb8000ec19caa84dd11e5ee2302569e2abb5601187e7c8c6c95a3211"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"hud drives each CLI headless through its JSON event stream (e.g. `opencode run --format json`, `claude -p --output-format stream-json`, `codex exec --json`) and resumes sessions via each engine's own resume mechanism.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_193656ecc5ce2d0a371f8622ccc4fdf9329990f7d4cb0bf067c0e392f1154577","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a624bf7601e28192c2682fea41dbf558b9a92ec6c726b6a01ac030e1eb27e932","slc_af496a3a1e6f0c8522e472799a68f68e91236d84dbef3c2ea1ad8e0bbf8a8e5c"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"The project claims zero dependencies, including a from-scratch QR encoder verified module-for-module against a reference implementation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_205c45bbb4306f8bd90047cf9fcba9c8b38d82ee217f29aa361ff16a90717f2f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_db95ea161781058d4b5f8236d705d6c2a6e44fcff44514bf4e392ab0f6c628e4"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"`hud install` wires a skills directory, a settings.json hook (backed up), codex prompt and AGENTS.md entries, and an opencode command file; `hud uninstall` removes all of it.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2bd1c0968d43df304d907c7b5e6946743afb83ae528a989dcfd5145a1133db61","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2dcc521f2a6ef35ae0d3d27ad8aa0ae5692d1f18cbbc2962ee5ab0c09a7b2de1","slc_6b04e62b7f148b4480ac77c445dec78794dc63ab3e636623d76e0676b97b7bac","slc_af496a3a1e6f0c8522e472799a68f68e91236d84dbef3c2ea1ad8e0bbf8a8e5c"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"Supports three engines: OpenCode (default), Claude Code, and Codex; `hud default claude` changes the engine used by bare `hud`.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","created_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3cf87527646756963f3db01c74162e9b3f3b0fb21a20d97f62408392d97c454e","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"adrida/hud-mode@98571ccf7101 snapshot 278eae6eb4afb581","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a624bf7601e28192c2682fea41dbf558b9a92ec6c726b6a01ac030e1eb27e932"],"source_ids":["src_6f9f4ad4d35352fdbddc65280f637215"],"text":"Shared agent links persist in a per-session ledger at ~/.claude/hud/links/ across restarts, and gauge selections persist in ~/.claude/hud/config.json.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:29:51Z","updated_by_operation":"op_5f86993659064bb6a7f4b56e07e51e44"}
